#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-CG0218 expect=violation domain=SV
#runLevel Info
#note "SV Assumption 11 (SDTMIG 3.2/3.3; #15 in 3.4): SV.EPOCH is the epoch of the element in progress when the visit starts; SE Assumption 10: an element's SEENDTC is the next element's SESTDTC, the transition instant belongs to the next element (end-exclusive). PLAN-cg0218-transition-day-precision (B2, owner 2026-10-05): a visit is judged against every element that MAY be in progress at its start and reported only when its EPOCH matches none of them, once, on the element that contains it (ERROR); partial dates on the same principle at INFO (Q4), once per candidate element. Movement: a blank EPOCH on the transition day 2012-07-09 matches no candidate ("" is neither SCREENING nor TREATMENT) and differs from TREATMENT, the element that contains the visit, so it is reported once on TREATMENT. Pins that EPOCH == SE.EPOCH and EPOCH != SE.EPOCH are exact complements on a blank cell. Today (option 1) the visit was not judged: RED against the old rule."
#expectViolationCount 1
#expectViolationAt row=1 severity=ERROR VISITNUM=2 SE.EPOCH=TREATMENT
dataset SV label="Subject Visits"
col STUDYID type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col USUBJID type=Char label="Unique Subject Identifier"
col VISITNUM type=Num label="Visit Number"
col VISIT type=Char label="Visit Name"
col SVSTDTC type=Char label="Start Date/Time of Visit"
col EPOCH type=Char label="Epoch"
---
CDISCPILOT01 | SV | 01-701-0001 | 2 | DAY 1 | 2012-07-09 | 
---

dataset SE label="Subject Elements"
col STUDYID type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col USUBJID type=Char label="Unique Subject Identifier"
col SESEQ type=Num label="Sequence Number"
col SESTDTC type=Char label="Start Date/Time of Element"
col SEENDTC type=Char label="End Date/Time of Element"
col EPOCH type=Char label="Epoch"
---
CDISCPILOT01 | SE | 01-701-0001 | 1 | 2012-07-06 | 2012-07-09 | SCREENING
CDISCPILOT01 | SE | 01-701-0001 | 2 | 2012-07-09 | 2012-08-20 | TREATMENT
---
